        <mxCell id="box_pipe" value="&lt;b&gt;Execution Flow &amp; Algorithmic Invariants&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Security Ingress: InputSanitizer prompt injection &amp; entropy defense&lt;br&gt;2. DSU Quotient Cache: O(α(N)) cluster lookup via _cluster_cache [Theorem 1]&lt;br&gt;3. Temporal Cutoff Horizon: Causal light-cone T(e) &lt;= audit_at&lt;br&gt;4. Monotone Bisect Search: O(log K) deletion_worker window scan [Theorem 2]&lt;br&gt;5. Poset 5-Tuple Sorter: (p, o, sys, res, ev, st) strictly injective total order [Theorem 3]&lt;br&gt;6. Witness Verification: PromptGuard guarantees P(Hallucination) = 0&lt;br&gt;7. Bounded LRU Buffer: ReplayTracer capped at 2,000 graphs [Theorem 4]" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eff6ff;strokeColor=#3b82f6;fontColor=#1e3a8a;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
